---
layout: changelog
title: "Appwrite Terminal is now in the Console"
date: 2026-06-22
cover: /images/blog/announcing-console-terminal/cover.avif
tags: console, cli
---

**Appwrite Terminal** runs the Appwrite CLI inside the Console. Open it from any project to list users, inspect deployments, and query resources without installing the CLI or leaving the page.

The panel reuses your Console session and the project you are viewing, so commands run against the right project immediately. Keyboard shortcuts, command history, and multiple tabs keep the workflow on the screen you already have open.

